{"source_paper_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011","question_group":"Q09","source_pdf_page":2,"parent_original_printed_prompt":"下列關於「日夜景象」的敘述，正確畫○，不正確打〤。","items":[{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q09|001","original_item_stem":"夜晚能看見月亮，是因為月亮自己會發光。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,450.9,78.1,465.91]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q09|002","original_item_stem":"白天時影子在陽光照射下，長度會由短變長，再由長變短。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,466.6,78.1,481.61]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q09|003","original_item_stem":"白天的天空，除了太陽、星星、雲朵外，也可能看到月亮。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,496.5,78.1,511.51]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q09|004","original_item_stem":"一天中，受陽光的照射，物體的影子方向會由西向東，再向西。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,526.3,78.1,541.31]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q09|005","original_item_stem":"月亮是夜晚的天空中，唯一可以看見的天體。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,556.1,78.1,571.11]}]}
